@startuml
title Web Application and API Communication

left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam roundcorner 14

actor "Authorized User" as User

package "Browser Applications" {
    component "Registration App" as RegApp
    component "Monitor App" as MonApp
}

component "FastAPI Backend" as Backend

User --> RegApp : Login, node, asset,\nuser and settings actions
RegApp --> User : Forms, results,\nstatus and warnings

User --> MonApp : Monitoring queries and\nmovement requests
MonApp --> User : Locations, alerts,\nactivity and node status

RegApp --> Backend : HTTPS / JSON\nBearer token
Backend --> RegApp : API response\nor error details

MonApp --> Backend : HTTPS / JSON\nBearer token
Backend --> MonApp : API response\nor error details

note bottom of Backend
The backend validates authentication,
role permission, submitted data,
and business rules.
end note

@enduml